{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_142_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_142","textTraditional":"一、十年，春，衞侯之弟黑背帥師侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_142_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_142","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，五卜郊，不從，乃不郊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_142_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_142","textTraditional":"夏四月，不時也。五卜，強也。乃者，亡乎人之辭也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_142_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_142","textTraditional":"三、五月，公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_142_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_142","textTraditional":"四、齊人來媵。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_142_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_142","textTraditional":"五、丙午，晉侯獳卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_142_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_142","textTraditional":"六、秋，七月，公如晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_142_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_142","textTraditional":"七、冬，十月。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}